  m_Name: ArcadeGameHaul
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 93
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Haul
  Description: 'Threshers only - a timed steal. Bales of loose prisms hang round the core. Your ball is
    in Mass Mode: swing it through a bale and every prism it touches turns your colour,
    sweep it through your own and they armour, and it lays your trail as it flies. Swing
    through a rival''s hoard to steal it back. An omni crystal spins the ball round you for
    twelve seconds. The most volume standing in your colour when the clock runs out wins.
    Higher intensities put the bales farther out under a shielded crust.'
